; ptrskel.def - linker module definition for the Phase 1 POINTDD-clone skeleton
;
; Modeled on the WiFi RTL8188EU driver's rtl88eu.def (same DDK/segment pattern).
; The device name (PTRSKEL$, a Phase-1 decoy - see ptr_hdr.asm) is in the
; header; this names the module and sets segment attributes.
LIBRARY PTRSKEL

DESCRIPTION 'POINTDD clone - Phase 1 skeleton (decoy name, load-safety proof only)'

PROTMODE

SEGMENTS
 HEADER   CLASS 'HEADER'
 CONST    CLASS 'CONST'
 _BSS     CLASS 'BSS'
 _DATA    CLASS 'DATA'
 RMCode   CLASS 'CODE' IOPL
 'Code'   CLASS 'CODE' IOPL
 _TEXT    CLASS 'CODE' IOPL
